Any camera movement is very slow and minimal.
{%- endif %}
The colors, white balance, brightness and lighting stay exactly as in the first frame
for the whole clip. No color grading, tint or exposure change.
Every object stays solid and in place: anything a person holds stays in the same hand for the
whole shot, and nothing in the scene appears, disappears or changes shape.
Only the people and objects already in the first frame are in the shot; no one new enters.
{% if dialogue %}
There are exactly {{ dialogue | map(attribute='speaker') | unique | list | length }} different speaking voices in this scene. Each voice is distinct.
